        "text": "Wave 1 planning thoughts.\n\nCurrent wave: zone 0:6, zone 1:4, zone 2:2, zone 3:2.\n\nKey insight: price = 10 + 5*(riders - 4*drivers_in_zone) if positive, else 10, capped at 80.\n\nEarnings per driver = price / (drivers in zone).\n\nFor Wave 1, zones with many riders benefit most when driven alone by a single driver:\n- Zone 0 (6 riders, 1 driver): price=20, earn=20, profit=15 (after 5 credit cost)\n- Zone 1 (4 riders, 1 driver): price=10, earn=10, profit=5\n- Zone 2 (2 riders, 1 driver): price=10, earn=10, profit=5\n- Zone 3 (2 riders, 1 driver): price=10, earn=10, profit=5\n\nPlanned: drive zone 0 alone. Communicate privately with driver_2 to avoid zone 0 conflict."
